-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Co-founder, The Bluestocking Club</span></b></span></div><font face=\"georgia, serif\"><img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/lndH9XtrzOXis8O_fZrWn8t-C4m_ONsWenoog7sQQvD9yG-EFYWhVyaqbSfjGZhNay-ZziFkP29RxrPBGWcsGSy7HlXH7Sg7M0N6UbaUnpCELShP5m3HW_Rw7PYOymcrP9SS--2eMnSXx0xxWP4nj8KVluOyQyeSCX4-4NZGSkX_ow8BS4nbAHbyylebw4A4ztIvqscSPYg=s0-d-e1-ft#https://docs.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=0B2gLKOJXLxcUamlubkZwOFF6NEE&amp;revid=0B2gLKOJXLxcUVTBGTFNPTEJYZ1pudVg2VExoVERwdk1XWlRJPQ\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
